-5\\end{aligned}|}$, where ${D}_{x}=$" :question/worked-solution "We are given the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-13x-6y=24 \\\\ \\,8x-5y=-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe determinant of the coefficient matrix is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =|\\begin{aligned}-13 & -6 \\\\ 8 & -5\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to construct ${D}_{x}$, we replace the first column of the coefficient matrix by the right-hand side column of the given system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{x} & =|\\begin{aligned}24 & -6 \\\\ -6 & -5\\end{aligned}|\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186329669 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119788 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4fcf3704-4856-5095-a6f4-7ec20d81f3c4" :knowledge-point/title "Expressing an Unknown in Terms of 2x2 Determinants"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "530f7601-74e9-540a-82ef-db390518a6fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}3 & 6 \\\\ 26 & 5\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}4 & 6 \\\\ 3 & 5\\end{aligned}|}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327654} {:answer/id #uuid "79e605a3-e423-5657-86b5-efaa7336486b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}32 & 6 \\\\ 26 & 5\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}-4 & 32 \\\\ -3 & 26\\end{aligned}|}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186327978} {:answer/id #uuid "81226cb7-cf78-526b-97c8-cf96fa7e7496" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}10 & 6 \\\\ 26 & 5\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}6 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}|}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328047} {:answer/id #uuid "964a6cc0-3d53-58e3-a342-0e852fe595d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}32 & 6 \\\\ 6 & 15\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}4 & -6 \\\\ 3 & 5\\end{aligned}|}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186328240} {